=== A. 17 CFR 240.14b-1: Obligation of registered brokers and dealers in connection with the prompt forwarding of certain communications to beneficial owners ===
official caption typography is Obligation of registered brokers and dealers in
  connection with the prompt forwarding of certain communications to beneficial
  owners.
official (b) heading typography is Dissemination and beneficial owner information
  requirements.
14b-1(b)(1): The broker or dealer shall respond, by first class mail or other equally
  prompt means, directly to the registrant no later than seven business days after
  the date it receives an inquiry made in accordance with § 240.14a-13(a) or
  § 240.14c-7(a) by indicting, by means of a search card or otherwise:
official typography is "by indicting" (not "indicating") and "first class mail"
  (no hyphen)
official (b)(1)(ii) typography is "addresses,and" (comma, no space) and, later in
  the same sentence, "names, addresses and securities positions" (spaces; no comma
  before "and"); this toy does not tidy either
14b-1(b)(2): The broker or dealer shall, upon receipt of the proxy, other proxy
  soliciting material, information statement, and/or annual report to security
  holders from the registrant or other soliciting person, forward such materials to
  its customers who are beneficial owners of the registrant's securities no later
  than five business days after receipt of the proxy material, information statement
  or annual report to security holders.
official typography is "and/or annual report to security holders"; official (b)(2)
  has no Oxford comma before "or annual report to security holders"; a straight
  apostrophe in "registrant's"
official (a) definitions exist and are named only; official typography uses
  typographic quotes around “registrant”
official (b)(3) non-objecting beneficial-owner names, addresses, and securities
  positions, the householding paragraph that names 14a-3(e)(1) / 14c-3(c), official
  (c) and later, 17 CFR 240.14b-2, and 17 CFR 240.14a-13 exist and are named only;
  this toy is not those catalogs
